{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>They are my sons whom Elohim has given me here.</b> They are my sons, not my sons' sons — they are those very sons whom Elohim has given me here, while I was yet alone here, as you yourself said: <b>those born to you in the land of Egypt before I came to you to Egypt</b>, and you said: <b>they are mine</b>."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:06.789091725Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}